i-_R_d6itdslfpf5ubsnlhj9ivb_" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false"><a rel="nofollow" class="text-sm text-tertiary" target="_blank" href="/@mickeyqiu">Mickey Qiu</a></button><span class="relative -top-px text-xs text-light-gray opacity-45">•</span><p class="text-sm text-tertiary">2mo ago</p></div><a class="text-base font-semibold text-primary" href="/p/fypro/hi-there-i-m-mickey-product-lead-at-fypro-ask-me-anything-about-creator-monetization"><span class="absolute inset-0 z-10"></span><h3>Hi there 👋 I&#x27;m Mickey, Product Lead at Fypro. Ask Me Anything about creator monetization!</h3></a><div><div class="" style="max-height:150px;overflow:hidden;position:relative"><div class="prose text-base text-primary"><p>Hey everyone I m Mickey, Product Lead of Fypro.</p><p>We built Fypro to solve a key pain point for TikTok creators: you grow loyal followers, but never truly own your audience or turn their trust into stable, long-term income.</p><p>This tool is for niche TikTok creators who want to convert followers into paying customers, build independent email lists, and earn sustainable income outside platform algorithms.</p><p> How Fypro works</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-20 ml-auto hidden flex-row items-start gap-4 self-start sm:flex"><button><div class="group/accessory flex size-12 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl border-2 border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-dark-800 bg-primary transition-all duration-300 data-[filled=true]:border-brand-500 dark:data-[filled=true]:border-brand-500 [@media(hover:hover)]:hover:border-brand-500 dark:[@media(hover:hover)]:hover:border-brand-500"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="stroke-brand-700 text-gray-700 group-data-[filled=true]/accessory:fill-brand-500 group-data-[filled=true]/accessory:stroke-brand-500 group-data-[filled=true]/accessory:text-brand-500 dark:[&amp;&gt;path]:stroke-gray-dark-300 size-[14px] stroke-[1.5px]"><path stro