u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e","contestPromptQuestion":null,"subject":{"__typename":"Post","id":"1172870","user":{"__typename":"User","id":"18280","isFollowed":false,"name":"Chris Messina","username":"chrismessina","avatarUrl":"https://ph-avatars.imgix.net/18280/0f6293a7-da1b-482d-b5ac-fb534f918888.png"},"product":{"__typename":"Product","id":"1248558","isSubscribed":false,"slug":"fypro","name":"Fypro","logoUuid":"cf32ce10-fb31-4842-9925-1d8bab906626.png","isNoLongerOnline":false},"slug":"fypro"},"user":{"__typename":"User","id":"8791797","name":"Mickey Qiu","username":"mickeyqiu","isProminent":false,"isAmbassador":false,"selectedBylineProduct":{"__typename":"Product","id":"1248558","name":"Fypro","slug":"fypro","logoUuid":"cf32ce10-fb31-4842-9925-1d8bab906626.png","isNoLongerOnline":false},"avatarUrl":"https://ph-avatars.imgix.net/8791797/c8609dc5-48f3-4ae8-8317-358a310bef6b.jpeg","canCrawl":false,"isAccountVerified":false,"topProductBadge":null,"topHunterBadge":null,"topLaunchBadge":null},"poll":null,"badges":["maker"],"isFlaggedByViewer":false,"award":null,"aiDetectionConfidence":null,"aiDetectionIsHumanized":null,"body":"\u003cp\u003e \u003ca href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/@swati_paliwal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"\u003e@swati_paliwal\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;Thanks! Two mistakes we help avoid:\u003c/p\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGetting buried in busywork. Building a personalized site, hunting for products, wiring it all together. A lot of creators burn out on setup before they ever start selling. We try to make that layer take minutes, not weeks.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eChasing hot products instead of the right one. The win is picking something that fits what your own followers trust you for, not just whatever's trending. That fit is what turns them into repeat buyers. 🙏\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e","parent":{"__typename":"Comment","id":"5504876"},"hasVoted":false,