,"poll":null,"badges":[],"isFlaggedByViewer":false,"award":null,"aiDetectionConfidence":null,"aiDetectionIsHumanized":null,"body":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/@steven_zhou8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"\u003e@steven_zhou8\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;Congrats! Quick question for creators thinking about switching from pure content to selling: what’s one common creator mistake Fypro helps them avoid that actually makes the biggest difference in converting followers into repeat customers?\u003c/p\u003e","parent":{"__typename":"Comment","id":"5495495"},"hasVoted":false,"isPinned":false,"score":null,"approvalStatus":"approved","inputInfo":null,"path":"/products/fypro?comment=5504876","canViewReplyBtn":false,"createdAt":"2026-07-02T10:49:10-07:00","canDestroy":false,"canEdit":false,"commentStatusReason":null,"isAutomaticAction":null,"moderatorName":null,"llmSpamGrade":null,"llmSpamReason":null,"llmContentQualityGrade":null,"llmContentQualityReason":null,"llmAuthenticityGrade":null,"llmAuthenticityReason":null,"votesCount":0,"url":"https://www.producthunt.com/products/fypro?comment=5504876"}}],"totalCount":6,"pageInfo":{"__typename":"PageInfo","endCursor":"NQ","hasNextPage":true}},"isHidden":false,"read":false,"bodyHtml":"\u003cp\u003eHey Product Hunt 👋\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eI'm Steven, Co-founder of Fypro.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFypro turns your TikTok followers into paying customers you actually own. \u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWe built this for creators who've grown a real audience — but haven't turned that trust into a business of their own yet.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf you post on TikTok and want your followers to become buyers, an email list, and real income, this is for you.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e✍️ Here's how it works:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDrop your TikTok handle. Fypro reads your account — your niche, your followers, and what's already working.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGet your plan: what to post next, and what to sell.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFypro builds it for you — your site, your store, and your content. Review, tweak, and go live.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy you want Fypro:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFollowers → customers: \u003c/strong\u003ethe audience you built becomes buyers you keep\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEverything in one place: \u003c/strong\u003eyour site, store, content, and customer list\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA store that stocks itself: \u003c/strong\u003etrending products matched to your niche, margin shown on every pick\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eContent in your own voice: \u003c/strong\u003efrom product to finished video in minutes\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOwn what you build: \u003c/strong\u003eemails and purchase history that are yours to keep, not just followers on a feed\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e🎉 To celebrate our launch, \u003cstrong\u003euse code PHPRO1 to get your first month of Pro for just $1!\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e💬 Join our Discord to get close to the Fypro team — share your account, ask us anything, and we'll help you set up your store:\u003ca href=\"https://discord.gg/ukq75weRnw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"\u003e \u003c/a\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://discord.gg/vXhq7mPDbB\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"\u003ehttps://discord.gg/vXhq7mPDbB\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eCome drop your handle and build with us 🚀\u003c/p\u003e","contestPromptQuestion":null,"subject":{"__typename":"Post","id":"1172870","user":{"__typename":"User","id":"18280","isFollowed":false,"name":"Chris Messina","username":"chrismessina","avatarUrl":"https://ph-avatars.imgix.net/18280/0f6293a7-da1b-482d-b5ac-fb534f918888.png"},"product":{"__typename":"Product","id":"1248558","isSubscribed":false,"slug":"fypro","name":"Fypro","logoUuid":"cf32ce10-fb31-4842-9925-1d8bab906626.png","isNoLongerOnline":false},"slug":"fypro"},"user":{"__typename":"User","id":"9767498","name":"Steven Zhou","username":"steven_zhou8","isProminent":false,"isAmbassador":false,"selectedBylineProduct":{"__typename":"Product","id":"1248558","name":"Fypro","slug":"fypro","logoUuid":"cf32ce10-fb31-4842-9925-1d8bab906626.png","isNoLongerOnline":false},"avatarUrl":"https://ph-avatars.imgix.net/9767498/06b25424-db99-40b6-852c-dc94688ab816.jpeg","canCrawl":false,"isAccountVerified":true,"topProductBadge":null,"topHunterBadge":null,"topLaunchBadge":null},"poll":null,"badges":["maker"],"isFlaggedByViewer":false,"award":null,"aiDetectionConfidence":null,"aiDetectionIsHumanized":null,"body":"\u003cp\u003eHey Product Hunt 👋\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eI'm Steven, Co-founder of Fypro.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFypro turns your TikTok followers into paying customers you actually own. \u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWe built this for creators who've grown a real audience — but haven't turned that trust into a business of their own yet.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf you post on TikTok and want your followers to become buyers, an email list, and real income, this is for you.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e✍️ Here's how it works:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDrop your TikTok handle. Fypro reads your account — your niche, your followers, and what's already working.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGet your plan: what to post next, and what to sell.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFypro builds it for you — your site, your store, and your content. Review, tweak, and go live.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy you want Fypro:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFollowers → customers: \u003c/strong\u003ethe audience you built becomes buyers you keep\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEverything in one place: \u003c/strong\u003eyour site, store, content, and customer list\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA store that stocks itself: \u003c/strong\u003etrending products matched to your niche, margin shown on every pick\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eContent in your own voice: \u003c/strong\u003efrom product to finished video in minutes\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOwn what you build: \u003c/strong\u003eemails and purchase history that are yours to keep, not just followers on a feed\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e🎉 To celebrate our launch, \u003cstrong\u003euse code PHPRO1 to get your first month of Pro for just $1!\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e💬 Join our Discord to get close to the Fypro team — share your account, ask us anything, and we'll help you set up your store:\u003ca href=\"https://discord.gg/ukq75weRnw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"\u003e \u003c/a\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://discord.gg/vXhq7mPDbB\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"\u003ehttps://discord.gg/vXhq7mPDbB\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eCome drop your handle and build with us 🚀\u003c/p\u003e","parent":null,"hasVoted":false,"isPinned":false,"score":null,"approvalStatus":"approved","inputInfo":null,"path":"/products/fypro?comment=5495495","canViewReplyBtn":false,"createdAt":"2026-06-30T14:21:38-07:00","canDestroy":false,"canEdit":false,"commentStatusReason":null,"isAutomaticAction":null,"moderatorName":null,"llmSpamGrade":null,"llmSpamReason":null,"llmContentQualityGrade":null,"llmContentQualityReason":null,"llmAuthenticityGrade":null,"llmAuthenticityReason":null,"votesCount":23,"url":"https://www.producthunt.com/products/fypro?comment=5495495"}},{"__typename":"CommentEdge","node":{"__typename":"Comment","id":"5505714","isSticky":false,"visibleRepliesCount":3,"repliesCount":3,"canAward":false,"replies":{"__typename":"CommentConnection","edges":[{"__typename":"CommentEdge","node":{"__typename":"Comment","id":"5506112","replies":{"__typename":"CommentConnection","edges":[{"__typename":"CommentEdge","node":{"__typename":"Comment","id":"5507927","replies":{"__typename":"CommentConnection","totalCount":0,"edges":[],"pageInfo":{"__typename":"PageInfo","endCursor":null,"hasNextPage":false}},"isSticky":false,"visibleRepliesCount":0,"repliesCount":0,"canAward":false,"isHidden":false,"read":false,"bodyHtml":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/@steven_zhou8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"\u003e@steven_zhou8\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;The \"closer to match their content style than how they talk to their audience\" honesty is why this thread turned out useful. Most makers would have insisted the voice replication is fully solved, and the moment I opened it up I would have known it wasn't. Naming what your tool doesn't do yet is what makes what it does do believable.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe forcing function point is the real thesis. Every creator I've watched go through it says the same thing after, \"I should have started the list two years earlier.\" The problem is nobody can hear that advice before the crisis lands, so the only real fix is making the default path the one that would have felt like overkill three months earlier. If Fypro makes owned-audience the day one default rather than the day 1000 emergency, that's the actual product win regardless of how good the voice replication gets.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/@zeya\" data-node-type=\"mention\" data-mention-type=\"user\" data-mention-id=\"zeya\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"\u003e@zeya\u003c/a\u003e thanks for backing Steven up on the voice question, the fact that both of you gave the same honest read instead of one of you spinning it more generously tells me something about how the team actually talks internally.\u003c/p\u003e","contestPromptQuestion":null,"subject":{"__typename":"Post","id":"1172870","user":{"__typename":"User","id":"18280","isFollowed":false,"name":"Chris Messina","username":"chrismessina","avatarUrl":"https://ph-avatars.imgix.net/18280/0f6293a7-da1b-482d-b5ac-fb534f918888.png"},"product":{"__typename":"Product","id":"1248558","isSubscribed":false,"slug":"fypro","name":"Fypro","logoUuid":"cf32ce10-fb31-4842-9925-1d8bab906626.png","isNoLongerOnline":false},"slug":"fypro"},"user":{"__typename":"User","id":"9936522","name":"Elias","username":"elias_motionfy","isProminent":false,"isAmbassador":false,"selectedBylineProduct":null,"avatarUrl":"https://ph-avatars.imgix.net/9936522/2c08f015-e461-4d4d-b2ff-4eb6788c3b95.png","canCrawl":false,"isAccountVerified":false,"topProductBadge":null,"topHunterBadge":null,"topLaunchBadge":null},"poll":null,"badges":[],"isFlaggedByViewer":false,"award":null,"aiDetectionConfidence":null,"aiDetectionIsHumanized":null,"body":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/@steven_zhou8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"\u003e@steven_zhou8\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;The \"closer to match their content style than how they talk to their audience\" honesty is why this thread turned out useful. Most makers would have insisted the voice replication is fully solved, and the moment I opened it up I would have known it wasn't. Naming what your tool doesn't do yet is what makes what it does do believable.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe forcing function point is the real thesis. Every creator I've watched go through it says the same thing after, \"I should have started the list two years earlier.\" The problem is nobody can hear that advice before the crisis lands, so the only real fix is making the default path the one that would have felt like overkill three months earlier. If Fypro makes owned-audience the day one default rather than the day 1000 emergency, that's the actual product win regardless of how good the voice replication gets.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/@zeya\" data-node-type=\"mention\" data-mention-type=\"user\" data-mention-id=\"zeya\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"\u003e@zeya\u003c/a\u003e thanks for backing Steven up on the voice question, the fact that both of you gave the same honest read instead of one of you spinning it more generously tells me something about how the team actually talks internally.\u003c/p\u003e","parent":{"__typename":"Comment","id":"5506112"},"hasVoted":false,"isPinned":false,"score":null,"approvalStatus":"approved","inputInfo":null,"path":"/products/fypro?comment=5507927","canViewReplyBtn":false,"createdAt":"2026-07-03T02:54:45-07:00","canDestroy":false,"canEdit":false,"commentStatusReason":null,"isAutomaticAction":null,"moderatorName":null,"llmSpamGrade":null,"llmSpamReason":null,"llmContentQualityGrade":null,"llmContentQualityReason":null,"llmAuthenticityGrade":null,"llmAuthenticityReason":null,"votesCount":0,"url":"https://www.producthunt.com/products/fypro?comment=5507927"}}],"totalCount":1,"pageInfo":{"__typename":"PageInfo","endCursor":"MQ","hasNextPage":false}},"isSticky":false,"visibleRepliesCount":1,"repliesCount":1,"canAward":false,"isHidden":false,"read":false,"bodyHtml":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/@elias_motionfy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"\u003e@elias_motionfy\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;This might be the sharpest comment in the thread, thank you Elias.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOn the translation point, you are right that it is the hard part. Almost nobody makes the eyeballs-to-email jump until a bad month forces them to. Our whole bet is to make owning that list the default from day one, so it happens before the crisis instead of after.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOn voice, I will be straight with you and not overclaim. Today it is closer to \"match their content style\" than \"match how they talk to their specific audience.\" The 4M corpus is really the format and trend layer, structure, hooks, pacing. The personal layer comes from the creator's own past content as sample data, so the more of their own videos we learn from, the better it gets, and every script is theirs to review and edit before anything ships. The parasocial layer you described, the inside references that land only because their audience knows them, is genuinely the harder problem, and I agree it is not fully solvable from patterns alone. That is exactly why we keep the creator in the loop rather than pretending the model nails it on its own. It is an area we are still actively working on.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAnd thank you on the 2,000. It means a lot that you read it as real evidence, because that is how we treat it too.\u003c/p\u003e","contestPromptQuestion":null,"subject":{"__typename":"Post","id":"1172870","user":{"__typename":"User","id":"18280","isFollowed":false,"name":"Chris Messina","username":"chrismessina","avatarUrl":"https://ph-avatars.imgix.net/18280/0f6293a7-da1b-482d-b5ac-fb534f918888.png"},"product":{"__typename":"Product","id":"1248558","isSubscribed":false,"slug":"fypro","name":"Fypro","logoUuid":"cf32ce10-fb31-4842-9925-1d8bab906626.png","isNoLongerOnline":false},"slug":"fypro"},"user":{"__typename":"User","id":"9767498","name":"Steven Zhou","username":"steven_zhou8","isProminent":false,"isAmbassador":false,"selectedBylineProduct":{"__typename":"Product","id":"1248558","name":"Fypro","slug":"fypro","logoUuid":"cf32ce10-fb31-4842-9925-1d8bab906626.png","isNoLongerOnline":false},"avatarUrl":"https://ph-avatars.imgix.net/9767498/06b25424-db99-40b6-852c-dc94688ab816.jpeg","canCrawl":false,"isAccountVerified":true,"topProductBadge":null,"topHunterBadge":null,"topLaunchBadge":null},"poll":null,"badges":["maker"],"isFlaggedByViewer":false,"award":null,"aiDetectionConfidence":null,"aiDetectionIsHumanized":null,"body":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/@elias_motionfy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"\u003e@elias_motionfy\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;This might be the sharpest comment in the thread, thank you Elias.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOn the translation point, you are right that it is the hard part. Almost nobody makes the eyeballs-to-email jump until a bad month forces them to. Our whole bet is to make owning that list the default from day one, so it happens before the crisis instead of after.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOn voice, I will be straight with you and not overclaim. Today it is closer to \"match their content style\" than \"match how they talk to their specific audience.\" The 4M corpus is really the format and trend layer, structure, hooks, pacing. The personal layer comes from the creator's own past content as sample data, so the more of their own videos we learn from, the better it gets, and every script is theirs to review and edit before anything ships. The parasocial layer you described, the inside references that land only because their audience knows them, is genuinely the harder problem, and I agree it is not fully solvable from patterns alone. That is exactly why we keep the creator in the loop rather than pretending the model nails it on its own. It is an area we are still actively working on.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAnd thank you on the 2,000. It means a lot that you read it as real evidence, because that is how we treat it too.\u003c/p\u003e","parent":{"__typename":"Comment","id":"5505714"},"hasVoted":false,"isPinned":false,"score":null,"approvalStatus":"approved","inputInfo":null,"path":"/products/fypro?comment=5506112","canViewReplyBtn":false,"createdAt":"2026-07-02T15:05:07-07:00","canDestroy":false,"canEdit":false,"commentStatusReason":null,"isAutomaticAction":null,"moderatorName":null,"llmSpamGrade":null,"llmSpamReason":null,"llmContentQualityGrade":null,"llmContentQualityReason":null,"llmAuthenticityGrade":null,"llmAuthenticityReason":null,"votesCount":0,"url":"https://www.producthunt.com/products/fypro?comment=5506112"}},{"__typename":"CommentEdge","node":{"__typename":"Comment","id":"5506140","replies":{"__typename":"CommentConnection","edges":[],"totalCount":0,"pageInfo":{"__typename":"PageInfo","endCursor":null,"hasNextPage":false}},"isSticky":false,"visibleRepliesCount":0,"repliesCount":0,"canAward":false,"isHidden":false,"read":false,"bodyHtml":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/@elias_motionfy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"\u003e@elias_motionfy\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;Appreciate this, Elias, especially the voice question because it's the right thing to push on.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHonestly it's closer to \"match their content style\" right now than the harder version you're describing. The 4M TikToks give us format, pacing, hook structure, that kind of thing. Getting to \"talks to their specific audience\" the way they actually do requires per creator sample data, you're right, and that's the part we're still working through rather than something we've solved. We'd rather be upfront about that than oversell it.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOn the DTC point, that's basically the whole thesis. Most creators don't feel the eyeballs vs. owned audience gap until a platform shift forces it on them, and by then they're rebuilding from zero. Trying to get people there earlier, before the forcing function hits.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","contestPromptQuestion":null,"subject":{"__typename":"Post","id":"1172870","user":{"__typename":"User","id":"18280","isFollowed":false,"name":"Chris Messina","username":"chrismessina","avatarUrl":"https://ph-avatars.imgix.net/18280/0f6293a7-da1b-482d-b5ac-fb534f918888.png"},"product":{"__typename":"Product","id":"1248558","isSubscribed":false,"slug":"fypro","name":"Fypro","logoUuid":"cf32ce10-fb31-4842-9925-1d8bab906626.png","isNoLongerOnline":false},"slug":"fypro"},"user":{"__typename":"User","id":"9973410","name":"Zeya","username":"zeya","isProminent":false,"isAmbassador":false,"selectedBylineProduct":{"__typename":"Product","id":"1248558","name":"Fypro","slug":"fypro","logoUuid":"cf32ce10-fb31-4842-9925-1d8bab906626.png","isNoLongerOnline":false},"avatarUrl":"https://ph-avatars.imgix.net/9973410/e0432d2c-3ef7-4632-9124-5e93ee6ae164.png","canCrawl":false,"isAccountVerified":false,"topProductBadge":null,"topHunterBadge":null,"topLaunchBadge":null},"poll":null,"badges":["maker"],"isFlaggedByViewer":false,"award":null,"aiDetectionConfidence":null,"aiDetectionIsHumanized":null,"body":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/@elias_motionfy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"\u003e@elias_motionfy\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;Appreciate this, Elias, especially the voice question because it's the right thing to push on.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHonestly it's closer to \"match their content style\" right now than the harder version you're describing. The 4M TikToks give us format, pacing, hook structure, that kind of thing. Getting to \"talks to their specific audience\" the way they actually do requires per creator sample data, you're right, and that's the part we're still working through rather than something we've solved. We'd rather be upfront about that than oversell it.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOn the DTC point, that's basically the whole thesis. Most creators don't feel the eyeballs vs. owned audience gap until a platform shift forces it on them, and by then they're rebuilding from zero. Trying to get people there earlier, before the forcing function hits.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","parent":{"__typename":"Comment","id":"5505714"},"hasVoted":false,"isPinned":false,"score":null,"approvalStatus":"approved","inputInfo":null,"path":"/products/fypro?comment=5506140","canViewReplyBtn":false,"createdAt":"2026-07-02T15:20:40-07:00","canDestroy":false,"canEdit":false,"commentStatusReason":null,"isAutomaticAction":null,"moderatorName":null,"llmSpamGrade":null,"llmSpamReason":null,"llmContentQualityGrade":null,"llmContentQualityReason":null,"llmAuthenticityGrade":null,"llmAuthenticityReason":null,"votesCount":1,"url":"https://www.producthunt.com/products/fypro?comment=5506140"}},{"__typename":"CommentEdge","node":{"__typename":"Comment","id":"5506261","replies":{"__typename":"CommentConnection","edges":[],"totalCount":0,"pageInfo":{"__typename":"PageInfo","endCursor":null,"hasNextPage":false}},"isSticky":false,"visibleRepliesCount":0,"repliesCount":0,"canAward":false,"isHidden":false,"read":false,"bodyHtml":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/@elias_motionfy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"\u003e@elias_motionfy\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;Thank you so much for this thoughtful, in-depth feedback — we truly appreciate your sharp observations around audience ownership and creator voice authenticity.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eYou’re completely right about owned audience assets: our core design philosophy is to help creators move past vanity follower counts to build permanent, monetizable customer data they fully control via email lists, breaking reliance on platform algorithm traffic. Getting creators to prioritize long-term owned growth over short-term views is indeed a key educational goal for us.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOn AI voice replication: our model first locks in your core content tone, pacing and stylistic habits from your public TikTok content. To nail the intimate, parasocial tone unique to your loyal audience, we let creators feed in their top-performing captions, comment replies and fan interactions as custom training samples. The more personalized context you provide, the closer the output matches how you naturally speak to your core fans, not just generic viral formatting. We keep refining fine-tuning tools to lower the sample data barrier for small creators too.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAnd thank you for celebrating our 2,000 active creators milestone! This community growth validates that our all-in-one content-to-commerce workflow solves real pain points for growing creators, and we’ll keep iterating based on feedback like yours.\u003c/p\u003e","contestPromptQuestion":null,"subject":{"__typename":"Post","id":"1172870","user":{"__typename":"User","id":"18280","isFollowed":false,"name":"Chris Messina","username":"chrismessina","avatarUrl":"https://ph-avatars.imgix.net/18280/0f6293a7-da1b-482d-b5ac-fb534f918888.png"},"product":{"__typename":"Product","id":"1248558","isSubscribed":false,"slug":"fypro","name":"Fypro","logoUuid":"cf32ce10-fb31-4842-9925-1d8bab906626.png","isNoLongerOnline":false},"slug":"fypro"},"user":{"__typename":"User","id":"9722458","name":"Huimin Wu","username":"huimin_wu","isProminent":false,"isAmbassador":false,"selectedBylineProduct":{"__typename":"Product","id":"1248558","name":"Fypro","slug":"fypro","logoUuid":"cf32ce10-fb31-4842-9925-1d8bab906626.png","isNoLongerOnline":false},"avatarUrl":"https://ph-avatars.imgix.net/9722458/original.jpeg","canCrawl":false,"isAccountVerified":false,"topProductBadge":null,"topHunterBadge":null,"topLaunchBadge":null},"poll":null,"badges":["maker"],"isFlaggedByViewer":false,"award":null,"aiDetectionConfidence":null,"aiDetectionIsHumanized":null,"body":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/@elias_motionfy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"\u003e@elias_motionfy\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;Thank you so much for this thoughtful, in-depth feedback — we truly appreciate your sharp observations around audience ownership and creator voice authenticity.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eYou’re completely right about owned audience assets: our core design philosophy is to help creators move past vanity follower counts to build permanent, monetizable customer data they fully control via email lists, breaking reliance on platform algorithm traffic. Getting creators to prioritize long-term owned growth over short-term views is indeed a key educational goal for us.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOn AI voice replication: our model first locks in your core content tone, pacing and stylistic habits from your public TikTok content. To nail the intimate, parasocial tone unique to your loyal audience, we let creators feed in their top-performing captions, comment replies and fan interactions as custom training samples. The more personalized context you provide, the closer the output matches how you naturally speak to your core fans, not just generic viral formatting. We keep refining fine-tuning tools to lower the sample data barrier for small creators too.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAnd thank you for celebrating our 2,000 active creators milestone! This community growth validates that our all-in-one content-to-commerce workflow solves real pain points for growing creators, and we’ll keep iterating based on feedback like yours.\u003c/p\u003e","parent":{"__typename":"Comment","id":"5505714"},"hasVoted":false,"isPinned":false,"score":null,"approvalStatus":"approved","inputInfo":null,"path":"/products/fypro?comment=5506261","canViewReplyBtn":false,"createdAt":"2026-07-02T16:30:49-07:00","canDestroy":false,"canEdit":false,"commentStatusReason":null,"isAutomaticAction":null,"moderatorName":null,"llmSpamGrade":null,"llmSpamReason":null,"llmContentQualityGrade":null,"llmContentQualityReason":null,"llmAuthenticityGrade":null,"llmAuthenticityReason":null,"votesCount":0,"url":"https://www.producthunt.com/products/fypro?comment=5506261"}}],"totalCount":3,"pageInfo":{"__typename":"PageInfo","endCursor":"Mw","hasNextPage":false}},"isHidden":false,"read":false,"bodyHtml":"\u003cp\u003eThe \"audience you built becomes buyers you keep\" framing is the part I wish more creators understood before they hit follower burnout. Watching a lot of DTC brands right now the pattern is the same at every stage, TikTok drives eyeballs, then everyone realizes eyeballs on TikTok aren't the same asset as email addresses on your own list. Getting people to make that translation before they need it is the hard part.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe AI-writes-in-your-voice claim is what I'd stress-test hardest. Voice for a creator isn't just word choice, it's rhythm and specific reference points that only work because their audience knows them. Trained on 4M viral TikToks probably captures the format layer well but voice is more parasocial than pattern-based. Curious how much of the voice replication is \"match their content style\" versus \"match how they talk to their specific audience\", because the second is a much harder problem and I don't know if it's solvable without deep sample data per creator.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAlso congrats on the 2,000 creators. That's not a demo number, that's real evidence.\u003c/p\u003e","contestPromptQuestion":null,"subject":{"__typename":"Post","id":"1172870","user":{"__typename":"User","id":"18280","isFollowed":false,"name":"Chris Messina","username":"chrismessina","avatarUrl":"https://ph-avatars.imgix.net/18280/0f6293a7-da1b-482d-b5ac-fb534f918888.png"},"product":{"__typename":"Product","id":"1248558","isSubscribed":false,"slug":"fypro","name":"Fypro","logoUuid":"cf32ce10-fb31-4842-9925-1d8bab906626.png","isNoLongerOnline":false},"slug":"fypro"},"user":{"__typename":"User","id":"9936522","name":"Elias","username":"elias_motionfy","isProminent":false,"isAmbassador":false,"selectedBylineProduct":null,"avatarUrl":"https://ph-avatars.imgix.net/9936522/2c08f015-e461-4d4d-b2ff-4eb6788c3b95.png","canCrawl":false,"isAccountVerified":false,"topProductBadge":null,"topHunterBadge":null,"topLaunchBadge":null},"poll":null,"badges":[],"isFlaggedByViewer":false,"award":null,"aiDetectionConfidence":null,"aiDetectionIsHumanized":null,"body":"\u003cp\u003eThe \"audience you built becomes buyers you keep\" framing is the part I wish more creators understood before they hit follower burnout. Watching a lot of DTC brands right now the pattern is the same at every stage, TikTok drives eyeballs, then everyone realizes eyeballs on TikTok aren't the same asset as email addresses on your own list. Getting people to make that translation before they need it is the hard part.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe AI-writes-in-your-voice claim is what I'd stress-test hardest. Voice for a creator isn't just word choice, it's rhythm and specific reference points that only work because their audience knows them. Trained on 4M viral TikToks probably captures the format layer well but voice is more parasocial than pattern-based. Curious how much of the voice replication is \"match their content style\" versus \"match how they talk to their specific audience\", because the second is a much harder problem and I don't know if it's solvable without deep sample data per creator.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAlso congrats on the 2,000 creators. That's not a demo number, that's real evidence.\u003c/p\u003e","parent":null,"hasVoted":false,"isPinned":false,"score":null,"approvalStatus":"approved","inputInfo":null,"path":"/products/fypro?comment=5505714","canViewReplyBtn":false,"createdAt":"2026-07-02T13:04:54-07:00","canDestroy":false,"canEdit":false,"commentStatusReason":null,"isAutomaticAction":null,"moderatorName":null,"llmSpamGrade":null,"llmSpamReason":null,"llmContentQualityGrade":null,"llmContentQualityReason":null,"llmAuthenticityGrade":null,"llmAuthenticityReason":null,"votesCount":1,"url":"https://www.producthunt.com/products/fypro?comment=5505714"}},{"__typename":"CommentEdge","node":{"__typename":"Comment","id":"5506890","isSticky":false,"visibleRepliesCount":2,"repliesCount":2,"canAward":false,"replies":{"__typename":"CommentConnection","edges":[{"__typename":"CommentEdge","node":{"__typename":"Comment","id":"5509860","replies":{"__typename":"CommentConnection","edges":[],"totalCount":0,"pageInfo":{"__typename":"PageInfo","endCursor":null,"hasNextPage":false}},"isSticky":false,"visibleRepliesCount":0,"repliesCount":0,"canAward":false,"isHidden":false,"read":false,"bodyHtml":"\u003ca href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/@endian_wang\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"\u003e@endian_wang\u003c/a\u003e Great question — and you’re right that multi-account becomes the norm once someone’s scaling. Today Fypro maps one primary account to one store + customer list, so multiple handles would currently run as separate stores rather than a unified one. Rolling several accounts into a single store + shared customer list isn’t live yet — it’s on our roadmap, and we’d rather ship it properly than bolt it on. Would genuinely love to hear how you’ve structured yours; the niche-split vs. regional-variant distinction is exactly the nuance we’re working through.","contestPromptQuestion":null,"subject":{"__typename":"Post","id":"1172870","user":{"__typename":"User","id":"18280","isFollowed":false,"name":"Chris Messina","username":"chrismessina","avatarUrl":"https://ph-avatars.imgix.net/18280/0f6293a7-da1b-482d-b5ac-fb534f918888.png"},"product":{"__typename":"Product","id":"1248558","isSubscribed":false,"slug":"fypro","name":"Fypro","logoUuid":"cf32ce10-fb31-4842-9925-1d8bab906626.png","isNoLongerOnline":false},"slug":"fypro"},"user":{"__typename":"User","id":"9973410","name":"Zeya","username":"zeya","isProminent":false,"isAmbassador":false,"selectedBylineProduct":{"__typename":"Product","id":"1248558","name":"Fypro","slug":"fypro","logoUuid":"cf32ce10-fb31-4842-9925-1d8bab906626.png","isNoLongerOnline":false},"avatarUrl":"https://ph-avatars.imgix.net/9973410/e0432d2c-3ef7-4632-9124-5e93ee6ae164.png","canCrawl":false,"isAccountVerified":false,"topProductBadge":null,"topHunterBadge":null,"topLaunchBadge":null},"poll":null,"badges":["maker"],"isFlaggedByViewer":false,"award":null,"aiDetectionConfidence":null,"aiDetectionIsHumanized":null,"body":"@endian_wang Great question — and you’re right that multi-account becomes the norm once someone’s scaling. Today Fypro maps one primary account to one store + customer list, so multiple handles would currently run as separate stores rather than a unified one. Rolling several accounts into a single store + shared customer list isn’t live yet — it’s on our roadmap, and we’d rather ship it properly than bolt it on. Would genuinely love to hear how you’ve structured yours; the niche-split vs. regional-variant distinction is exactly the nuance we’re working through.","parent":{"__typename":"Comment","id":"5506890"},"hasVoted":false,"isPinned":false,"score":null,"approvalStatus":"approved","inputInfo":null,"path":"/products/fypro?comment=5509860","canViewReplyBtn":false,"createdAt":"2026-07-03T10:05:42-07:00","canDestroy":false,"canEdit":false,"commentStatusReason":null,"isAutomaticAction":null,"moderatorName":null,"llmSpamGrade":null,"llmSpamReason":null,"llmContentQualityGrade":null,"llmContentQualityReason":null,"llmAuthenticityGrade":null,"llmAuthenticityReason":null,"votesCount":0,"url":"https://www.producthunt.com/products/fypro?comment=5509860"}},{"__typename":"CommentEdge","node":{"__typename":"Comment","id":"5510325","replies":{"__typename":"CommentConnection","edges":[],"totalCount":0,"pageInfo":{"__typename":"PageInfo","endCursor":null,"hasNextPage":false}},"isSticky":false,"visibleRepliesCount":0,"repliesCount":0,"canAward":false,"isHidden":false,"read":false,"bodyHtml":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/@endian_wang\" data-node-type=\"mention\" data-mention-type=\"user\" data-mention-id=\"endian_wang\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"\u003e@endian_wang\u003c/a\u003e Thanks a lot your great question! Having multiple TikTok accounts is a trending. Currently, Fypro could build several sites for different accounts. Also creator could build one unified store from main account and add other links of account on the site. Not only a store, but also a link-in-bio. In this way, all the accounts share one customer list.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eProducts would be selected from the DNA of provided account. You provide an important next step for us, taking more accounts into consideration as a whole picture of the creator. Thanks a ton!\u003c/p\u003e","contestPromptQuestion":null,"subject":{"__typename":"Post","id":"1172870","user":{"__typename":"User","id":"18280","isFollowed":false,"name":"Chris Messina","username":"chrismessina","avatarUrl":"https://ph-avatars.imgix.net/18280/0f6293a7-da1b-482d-b5ac-fb534f918888.png"},"product":{"__typename":"Product","id":"1248558","isSubscribed":false,"slug":"fypro","name":"Fypro","logoUuid":"cf32ce10-fb31-4842-9925-1d8bab906626.png","isNoLongerOnline":false},"slug":"fypro"},"user":{"__typename":"User","id":"8791797","name":"Mickey Qiu","username":"mickeyqiu","isProminent":false,"isAmbassador":false,"selectedBylineProduct":{"__typename":"Product","id":"1248558","name":"Fypro","slug":"fypro","logoUuid":"cf32ce10-fb31-4842-9925-1d8bab906626.png","isNoLongerOnline":false},"avatarUrl":"https://ph-avatars.imgix.net/8791797/c8609dc5-48f3-4ae8-8317-358a310bef6b.jpeg","canCrawl":false,"isAccountVerified":false,"topProductBadge":null,"topHunterBadge":null,"topLaunchBadge":null},"poll":null,"badges":["maker"],"isFlaggedByViewer":false,"award":null,"aiDetectionConfidence":null,"aiDetectionIsHumanized":null,"body":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/@endian_wang\" data-node-type=\"mention\" data-mention-type=\"user\" data-mention-id=\"endian_wang\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"\u003e@endian_wang\u003c/a\u003e Thanks a lot your great question! Having multiple TikTok accounts is a trending. Currently, Fypro could build several sites for different accounts. Also creator could build one unified store from main account and add other links of account on the site. Not only a store, but also a link-in-bio. In this way, all the accounts share one customer list.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eProducts would be selected from the DNA of provided account. You provide an important next step for us, taking more accounts into consideration as a whole picture of the creator. Thanks a ton!\u003c/p\u003e","parent":{"__typename":"Comment","id":"5506890"},"hasVoted":false,"isPinned":false,"score":null,"approvalStatus":"approved","inputInfo":null,"path":"/products/fypro?comment=5510325","canViewReplyBtn":false,"createdAt":"2026-07-03T17:39:23-07:00","canDestroy":false,"canEdit":false,"commentStatusReason":null,"isAutomaticAction":null,"moderatorName":null,"llmSpamGrade":null,"llmSpamReason":null,"llmContentQualityGrade":null,"llmContentQualityReason":null,"llmAuthenticityGrade":null,"llmAuthenticityReason":null,"votesCount":0,"url":"https://www.producthunt.com/products/fypro?comment=5510325"}}],"totalCount":2,"pageInfo":{"__typename":"PageInfo","endCursor":"Mg","hasNextPage":false}},"isHidden":false,"read":false,"bodyHtml":"\u003cp\u003eCongrats on the launch! \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOne thing I haven't seen asked: a lot of creators past a certain scale run multiple 